Body:
@SQLServerIO I created and am using this: https://github.com/CarloWood/opencode/tree/CW03-toggle-mouse-handling

with
```
{
  "disable_mouse": false,
  "keybinds": {
    "mouse_toggle": "f6"
  }
}
```
in `$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/opencode/tui.json`

I don’t know enough about all this to tell whether this is a proper fix or just a workaround, but setting `frequency_penalty` to `2.0` (the maximum) and `temperature` to `0.3` made Kimi K2.5 usable for me.

```jsonc
{
	"provider": {
		"openrouter": {
			"models": {
				"moonshotai/kimi-k2.5": {
					"options": {
						"frequency_penalty": 2.0,
						"temperature": 0.3,
					},
				},
			},
		},
	},
}
```

Here is how a sample config the new props:
```json
{
  "$schema": "https://opencode.ai/config.json",
  "provider": {
    "my-custom-github-copilot": {
      "name": "My Custom GitHub Copilot",
      "auth_provider": "github-copilot",
      "npm": "@ai-sdk/github-copilot",
      "models": {
        "gpt-5": {},
        "claude-sonnet-4.5": {},
        "gemini-2.5-pro": {}
      }
    }
  }
}
